{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o013a","title":"曹操迎汉献帝都许任大将军荀彧任侍中尚书令","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o013a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"曹操迎汉献帝都许任大将军荀彧任侍中尚书令","evidence":["xunyu-e-o013a-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o026a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"曹操迎汉献帝都许","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o026a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-d38826d5aa1aa820de3b","label":"正文","text":"曹操徙汉献帝至许","evidence":["chengguo-q-95cb1fafcb0bfef01d7f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"奉迎受任","evidence":["xunyu-e-o013a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"迁都授官","evidence":["xunyu-e-o013a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"受任","evidence":["xunyu-e-o013a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":196,"label":"建安元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y196","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o012","basis":"建安元年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o013a-q","xunyu-q-o012","xianzhu-q-o010","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o013a-q","source_order":[10,59,"O013a"],"related_events":[{"event":"liusima-e2-wei015-074","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374","xunyu-e-o013a-q"]}],"order":2408},{"id":"liusima-e2-wei015-074","title":"太祖西迎天子过新郑，杨沛进干椹，太祖甚喜","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-9a724f17db2aa14771f6","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"太祖西迎天子过新郑，杨沛进干椹，太祖甚喜","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0039","role":"献干椹","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"西迎天子过新郑受献干椹","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374","related_events":[{"event":"xunyu-e-o013a","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374","xunyu-e-o013a-q"]}],"order":3374}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0100","name":"荀彧","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-95cb1fafcb0bfef01d7f","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-089f6b5dc0e8a9b3cd1e","layer":"original","quote":"即遣使诣奉，徙大驾至许。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":336,"end":348},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o026a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-575c8f171eb8425f4603","layer":"original","quote":"太祖乃迎天子都许。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9},{"id":"liusima-q-2fe82e7dbc75e1f92374","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-917aeff0af2d8ac16c44","layer":"pei","quote":"会太祖为兖州刺史，西迎天子，所将千余人皆无粮。过新郑，沛谒见，乃皆进干椹。太祖甚喜","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":301,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":74,"end":115},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o010","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-41f463c31e36d9086831","layer":"original","quote":"袁术来攻先主，先主拒之于盱眙、淮阴〖10〗。曹公表先主为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。是岁，建安元年也。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"xunyu-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-30c58c612947594028f4","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遂至洛阳奉迎天子，都许。天子拜太祖大将军；进彧为（汉）侍中，守尚书令，常居中持重〖15〗。﹝一﹞太祖虽征伐在外，军国事皆与彧筹焉。﹝二﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70},{"id":"xunyu-q-o012","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e204c2e6a37c8c4659f5","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年，太祖击破黄巾。汉献帝自河东，还洛阳。太祖议奉迎，都许，或以“山东未平，韩暹、杨奉新将天子到洛阳，北连张杨，未可猝制〖1〗”。彧劝太祖曰：“〔昔晋文纳周襄王而诸侯景从〕〖2〗，高祖东伐为义帝缟素而天下归心〖3〗。自天子播越〖4〗，将军首倡义兵，徒以山东扰乱〖5〗，未能远赴关右；然犹分遣将帅，蒙险通使〖6〗；虽御难于外〖7〗，乃心无不在王室〖8〗：是将军匡天下之素志也〖9〗。今车驾旋轸〖10〗，〔东京榛芜〕；义士有存本之思，百姓感旧而增哀。诚因此时，奉主上以从民望，大顺也；秉至公以服雄杰，大略也；扶弘义以致英俊〖11〗，大德也。天下虽有逆节〖12〗，必不能为累〖13〗，明矣。韩暹、杨奉其敢为害！若不时定〖14〗，四方生心；后虽虑之，无及！”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":327}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
